# D19: `break <value>` / loop-as-expression was removed from the surface.
# `break` takes no value; this must be rejected at parse with a teaching
# error, never accepted (the old half-feature silently discarded the value
# at lowering). Negative fixture: `gg check` must fail.
void main():
    int result = 0
    loop:
        break 42
    print(result)
